cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it implements."
title: "rotorwave: wave propagation analysis of rotors with longitudinal periodicity"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-02
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/patrickblamas/rotorwave"
url: "https://github.com/patrickblamas/rotorwave"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python implementation of the wave analysis of rotors with
  longitudinal periodicity: Bloch-Floquet dispersion diagrams separated by
  whirl direction, band gap detection, wave-Campbell diagrams and the
  directional frequency response of the finite rotor.
authors:
